WEBVTT

00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:31.530
I-I'm Cyan Hijirikawa, first year, class 3.
I'd like to join the club.

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:33.820
Pleased to meet you...

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:36.530
All right!

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:45.710
I decided that I would definitely go today...

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:53.470
But won't they think I'm weird for wanting
to join at such a weird time in the semester?

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:57.720
I should have joined
right after school started...

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:03.060
No, Cyan, you have to muster
all your courage and do this now!

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:13.320
♪ Ready... 1, 2, 3, GO! ♪

00:01:13.530 --> 00:01:16.160
♪ Love life! Very! Very! Happy! ♪

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:18.950
♪ Friendship life! Bouncing, jumping! ♪

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:21.660
♪ Adventure life! Heart-pounding, OK? ♪

00:01:21.870 --> 00:01:24.660
♪ Song of youth! Come on ready? Let's go! ♪

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:30.170
♪ Rushing out onto the road to
school with the blue sky behind us ♪

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:32.210
♪ I like that! I like this, too! ♪

00:01:32.420 --> 00:01:35.720
♪ I'll take it all, all of it~ ♪

00:01:35.930 --> 00:01:38.590
♪ A girl who imagines love is all romance ♪

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:41.350
♪ If I can attack, I'll do it boldly ♪

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:45.810
♪ Let's find an original vision for the future ♪

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:51.770
♪ Sometimes, we'll have a secret love advice time ♪

00:01:51.980 --> 00:01:54.650
♪ Who do you like? ♪

00:01:54.860 --> 00:02:02.450
♪ You've got a green light for love now!
It's your chance to move forward! ♪

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:03.290
♪ So, let's just ♪

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:06.120
♪ Have a blast! Fall in love! ♪

00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:08.120
♪ Our youth is non-stop! ♪

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:10.290
♪ Run! Aim for the future! ♪

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:12.130
♪ Everyone gather ♪

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:13.800
♪ For a happy ending! ♪

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:17.340
♪ Will tomorrow be happy or sad?
Will we idle our time away? ♪

00:02:17.550 --> 00:02:19.430
♪ We'll work hard! ♪

00:02:19.640 --> 00:02:22.720
♪ I want to keep dreaming forever! ♪

00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:25.810
♪ Let's fly out into the
world with all our strength! ♪

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:28.730
♪ Love life! Very! Very! Happy! ♪

00:02:28.940 --> 00:02:31.480
♪ Friendship life! Bouncing, jumping! ♪

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:34.280
♪ Adventure life! Heart-pounding, OK? ♪

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:37.490
♪ Song of youth! Come on ready? Let's go! ♪

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:40.200
Yay!

00:02:55.630 --> 00:02:57.340
♪ So let's just ♪

00:02:57.550 --> 00:03:00.180
♪ Have a blast ♪

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:02.760
♪ Fall in love ♪

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:06.810
♪ Our youth is non-stop ♪

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:13.060
♪ I want to keep dreaming forever ♪

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:22.200
♪ Let's fly out into the
world with all our strength ♪

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:41.260
I need to hurry up and turn in
my application to join the club!

00:03:41.470 --> 00:03:45.430
The longer I wait,
the harder it'll be to join...

00:03:45.640 --> 00:03:49.350
I think they have training camp
during the Golden Week holiday, too.

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:52.100
No matter what, I need
to join the club before that!

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:56.610
I'm already shy under
normal circumstances... Jeez!

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:01.110
I have to do it tomorrow!

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:04.820
But for now, I'll psych
myself up with a game first!

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:06.870
All right!

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:15.290
Yay! Whoohoo! I got a high score!

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:18.670
Oh? It's called Strawberry Heart?

00:04:18.880 --> 00:04:20.760
It's so cute!

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:22.970
H-Huh?

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:26.010
Hey! What's going on?

00:04:27.220 --> 00:04:29.390
What is this?

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:35.060
Wh-What's that?!

00:04:56.880 --> 00:05:00.880
What's going on...?!

00:05:14.440 --> 00:05:15.770
Huh?

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:21.730
Trichronika!

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:24.950
- You're the best!
- Shu☆zo...!

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:32.120
♪ I know what the real you is like ♪

00:05:32.330 --> 00:05:35.580
♪ You're leading yourself around by the nose ♪

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:38.290
- ♪ You stumble and come to a stop ♪

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:41.880
- No way...!

00:05:41.880 --> 00:05:42.880
- ♪ Dreams are not that easy ♪

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:48.590
♪ No matter the experience,
it'll be precious to you ♪

00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:51.350
♪ Forgetting is not being brave ♪

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:52.680
- ♪ Jump out just as you are ♪

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:54.930
- Huh? What? What's going on?
- ♪ Jump out just as you are ♪

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:58.350
- What happened to me?
- ♪ Ready... 1, 2, 3! ♪

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:04.030
♪ Because we are the suns of this world ♪

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:11.490
♪ Our mission is to make the flowers bloom ♪

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:17.160
♪ Shining so bright, it makes you smile ♪

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:18.960
♪ We'll wait for you ♪

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:22.710
♪ Ready to burst into flames no matter when ♪

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:26.920
♪ Come stay by our side ♪

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:36.930
Wow... But this has to be a dream, right?

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:41.310
But... But for some reason, I'm so excited!

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:45.190
I want to put on a wonderful
concert like this soon, too!

00:06:45.400 --> 00:06:47.860
Kai, Riku, let's go!

00:06:48.070 --> 00:06:49.820
With the glittering stars of you twins,

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:51.740
my own shining star presence,

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:55.160
and the passionate hearts of the fans—

00:06:55.370 --> 00:06:58.370
We'll create an infinite
rainbow across the galaxy!

00:06:58.580 --> 00:07:00.500
Yes, Shu☆zo!

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:02.170
Okay!

00:07:08.590 --> 00:07:10.510
Huh? What's this sound?

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:24.190
What is this place?

00:07:24.400 --> 00:07:25.610
What happened?

00:07:25.820 --> 00:07:26.400
Shu☆zo!

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:27.650
Are you all right?

00:07:27.860 --> 00:07:30.700
Kai, Riku, be careful!

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:32.200
What's that?

00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:36.330
What happened?

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:39.580
If it's a dream, I'm ready to wake up now!

00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:47.170
It's coming!

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:06.480
That girl is...?

00:08:06.690 --> 00:08:09.990
Is she a fan? Why is she on this side?

00:08:10.320 --> 00:08:14.160
Only Myumons with music skill
should be able to enter this space.

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:22.000
- Shu☆zo!
- Kai!
- Riku!

00:08:22.210 --> 00:08:23.580
- Be careful!
- Why is a dark monster here?

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:25.000
- Oh, no!
- Why is a dark monster here?

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:26.790
President, look!

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.750
What's that? Who is she...?

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:31.170
Did a die-hard fan wander in somehow?

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:32.590
It's dangerous!

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:35.010
It's an emergency, pyuru!

00:08:35.220 --> 00:08:36.930
Hello, kitten.

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:41.310
Don't worry. Leave the dark monster to us.

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:44.650
You go ahead and hide in a safe place.

00:08:47.110 --> 00:08:49.650
Twins, follow me!

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:57.120
Watch out for the attacks
from that thing's hands!

00:08:57.320 --> 00:09:01.120
If it catches you, it'll suck out your energy
and turn you into a dark monster, too!

00:09:01.330 --> 00:09:02.540
Roger!

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:32.650
Kai!

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:38.870
Look out!

00:09:42.870 --> 00:10:02.560
Shu☆zo!

00:10:02.760 --> 00:10:03.640
Big Brother!

00:10:03.850 --> 00:10:06.310
Drat! How can you do that to Shu☆zo?!

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:08.230
Wait, Big Brother!

00:10:08.440 --> 00:10:10.900
Here I go!

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:16.150
Kai, Riku!

00:10:28.170 --> 00:10:29.790
His Melodisian stone!

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.290
This is not good.

00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:34.710
At this rate, he'll be
turned into a dark monster.

00:10:34.920 --> 00:10:36.880
It'll be bad if it's not stopped, pyuru!

00:10:37.090 --> 00:10:39.050
But how...?

00:10:41.510 --> 00:10:44.470
Wh... What should I do?

00:10:49.650 --> 00:10:51.940
Rock 'n' roll!

00:10:56.820 --> 00:10:59.200
Huh? Is this guitar that Strawberry—?

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:03.410
There's no time! Get close to the
monster and strum Strawberry Heart!

00:11:03.620 --> 00:11:05.370
Huh? It's talkin—

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:11.750
The soulful rock will synchronize with your
Melodisian stone and spark amazing energy!

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:15.090
Um, can you say it in a way I can understand?

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:20.010
There's no time for that! Hurry up
and go save them! There's no time!

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:23.140
I need to...?

00:11:31.060 --> 00:11:34.560
Kai... Riku... Hang in there!

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:39.950
Shu☆zo... Sorry... In order
to protect someone like me...

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:41.660
Big Brother...

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:48.870
Twins... For the fans, too...
We won't give up until the end...!

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:51.710
Shu☆zo...

00:11:59.720 --> 00:12:02.050
It was such a wonderful concert...

00:12:02.260 --> 00:12:07.430
Such a wonderful song... I won't
forgive that monster for getting in the way!

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:18.980
She's...?

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:20.530
Wow...

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:22.110
So cool, pyuru!

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:27.580
Isn't that the legendary guitar,
Strawberry Heart?!

00:12:37.340 --> 00:12:38.590
They're back!

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:45.340
She's shining to the max, isn't she?

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:49.970
<i>So, let's just</i>

00:12:50.180 --> 00:12:52.980
<i>Have a blast! Fall in love!</i>

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:55.060
<i>Our youth is non-stop!</i>

00:12:55.270 --> 00:12:57.150
<i>Run! Aim for the future!</i>

00:12:57.360 --> 00:12:58.650
<i>Everyone gather</i>

00:12:58.860 --> 00:13:00.650
<i>For a happy ending!</i>

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:04.200
<i>Will tomorrow be happy or sad?</i>
<i>Will we idle our time away?</i>

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:06.110
<i>We'll work hard!</i>

00:13:06.320 --> 00:13:09.450
<i>I want to keep dreaming forever!</i>

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:12.660
<i>Let's fly out into the</i>
<i>world with all our strength!</i>

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:15.420
<i>Innocent life! Smiles are charming!</i>

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:18.170
<i>Completely invincible! I feel like hopping!</i>

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:20.960
<i>Aim for the top! If I make it, I'm lucky?</i>

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:24.420
<i>Breaking through limits!</i>
<i>Come on ready? Let's go!</i>

00:13:44.820 --> 00:13:48.200
Ow...

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:52.490
Huh? I'm back to my old body?

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:56.710
Something seems a little different, though...

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:04.170
I wonder where I am...

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:07.090
Why am I in a place like this...?

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:10.430
Excuse me, can I talk to you for a sec?

00:14:10.640 --> 00:14:12.430
E-Eh...?

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:16.730
Hey!

00:14:16.940 --> 00:14:19.190
The egg talked?!

00:14:19.400 --> 00:14:22.230
Is it like when you see a well-boiled egg...

00:14:22.440 --> 00:14:26.950
...but the yolk is runny when you take a bite?

00:14:27.150 --> 00:14:28.950
And you're like, oh dear,
what can I do? Or like...

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:31.240
After it was stewed in <i>miso oden</i>
for a whole day and night...

00:14:31.450 --> 00:14:35.410
You take a bite thinking it
must've really absorbed the flavor...

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:37.580
...only to find the inside is
still pure white and yellow!

00:14:37.790 --> 00:14:40.460
And you're like, you stupid egg!
Is that how it is?!

00:14:40.670 --> 00:14:43.130
By the way, do you like your eggs
fried sunny side up or over easy?

00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:45.130
Stop!

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:50.720
President Maple, how about
you tell her what you came to say?

00:14:52.930 --> 00:14:53.890
Ahem!

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:58.730
Will you join my agency?
We will definitely take care of you.

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:00.770
Um... I...

00:15:00.980 --> 00:15:07.400
I should have introduced myself sooner.
I'm Maple Arisugawa, the CEO of BRR.

00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:09.860
Those girls are from our band...

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:14.620
...Plasmagica. I'm Chuchu, the vocalist
and guitarist. Nice to meet you!

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:16.910
I'm the bassist, Retoree.

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:19.250
I'm the drummer, Moa, pyuru!

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:20.960
What's your name?

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:28.090
Uh... Um, I'm... I'm C-Cyan, meow!

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:36.220
I stuttered on my name!
And why did I say "meow"?

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:38.480
Come now, get in!

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:40.730
Um, in this...?

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:42.150
Yes.

00:15:42.940 --> 00:15:44.940
Hey!

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:49.190
- Shu☆zo!
- Kai!
- Riku!

00:15:52.490 --> 00:15:54.370
Hey!

00:15:59.250 --> 00:16:01.210
Hello, kitten!

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:05.210
You really saved us back there.
Thanks a million!

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:07.300
Uh, it's not that big a...

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:09.460
You're really good at playing guitar.

00:16:09.670 --> 00:16:11.220
You're pretty good!

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:14.220
We want to do something in return,
so won't you join our agency?

00:16:14.430 --> 00:16:16.720
Uh... Um... I...

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:19.140
She's gonna sign with <i>us</i>!

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:22.640
Even if you're Trichronika,
a band signed with a major label,

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:23.850
I won't let you cut in!

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:26.020
- Shu☆zo, it's dangerous.
- Oh, thanks.

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:30.280
Ow, ow...! I'm caught! I'm caught!

00:16:31.740 --> 00:16:35.070
Let's meet again!

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:39.330
Just because you guys are kind of popular...

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:43.460
My agency will also... someday... definitely...

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:51.260
Oh, but your guitar solo earlier surprised me.

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:53.760
You got the dark monster in one hit, too, pyuru!

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:57.640
Um, I don't really remember
what happened earlier...

00:16:57.850 --> 00:17:00.270
I mean, everything's just been so strange...

00:17:00.470 --> 00:17:03.180
You don't have to be so humble.

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:07.860
I just followed them without thinking...
I hope this is all right...

00:17:10.400 --> 00:17:12.650
Um, is this it?

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:13.530
Yep.

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:17.910
This is my agency, Banded Rocking Records!

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:20.740
Here you go.

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:26.710
I'm the president's secretary
and the band manager, Angelica.

00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:28.170
Nice to meet you.

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:30.090
L-Likewise...

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:31.670
Make yourself at home.

00:17:31.880 --> 00:17:33.090
Let me get straight to the point.

00:17:33.300 --> 00:17:36.760
You're not affiliated
with another agency, are you?

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:41.140
Um, no... I would like to join one very much, but...

00:17:41.350 --> 00:17:45.310
it's been kind of hard
getting my foot in the door...

00:17:45.520 --> 00:17:47.190
How should I put it...?

00:17:47.400 --> 00:17:51.520
For someone with your ability to
not get a contract with any agency...

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:54.940
It's not really something as
big of a deal as a contract...

00:17:55.150 --> 00:17:57.950
All I have left is to turn in
my application to join the club,

00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:00.120
but I can't quite do it...

00:18:00.330 --> 00:18:01.950
Then that makes things easier!

00:18:02.160 --> 00:18:06.000
Do you think you could sign with BRR?

00:18:06.210 --> 00:18:07.960
Uh... Um...

00:18:08.170 --> 00:18:12.090
I mean, I know we look
like a small label right now,

00:18:12.300 --> 00:18:15.170
but I have no intention
of letting it end like this.

00:18:15.380 --> 00:18:20.180
In addition to Plasmagica here,
there's also another band full of rowdy boys.

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:23.060
Using these two bands
as the cornerstone for BRR,

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:26.850
I want wonderful music to
reach people around the world.

00:18:27.060 --> 00:18:31.360
The future will surely be sunshine!
Now, come to the shining stage!

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:33.150
President...

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:48.500
Oh, there's nothing for you to worry about.

00:18:48.710 --> 00:18:53.040
With your guitar skill, you're unbeatable.

00:18:53.250 --> 00:19:00.510
We wanted a fuller sound and were
thinking of getting another guitarist.

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:05.220
If you're not in another band,
why don't you join our band?

00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:08.270
- ...join our band?
- No way!

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:12.440
These are the words I want
to hear the most right now!

00:19:12.650 --> 00:19:16.610
Joining a band, like I always wanted...

00:19:16.820 --> 00:19:17.860
You don't have to if you don't want to, though.

00:19:18.070 --> 00:19:21.280
I-I want to join your band, meow!

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:25.870
I look forward to working with you!

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:28.000
This concludes negotiations, huh?

00:19:28.200 --> 00:19:29.620
It's decided!

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:33.040
The new Plasmagica is born, pyuru!

00:19:35.550 --> 00:19:37.880
Wait, huh? Wait a minute, wait a minute.

00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:40.260
Why am I here again?

00:19:40.470 --> 00:19:43.640
Where <i>am</i> I, anyway?

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:45.510
U-Um...

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:52.770
Oh, well.

00:19:54.480 --> 00:19:56.110
You failed?

00:19:56.320 --> 00:20:00.200
My apologies. There were
some unforeseen circumstances...

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:03.620
Small failures will lead to big mistakes.

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:05.780
Consider this your last chance.

00:20:05.990 --> 00:20:07.290
Yes, sir!

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:14.420
Grateful King, have you completed the song?

00:20:17.210 --> 00:20:18.710
Oh, well.

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:22.760
You cannot leave that room
until you complete the song.

00:20:22.970 --> 00:20:26.470
In addition, this exclusive
contract with Unicorn Virtual Music

00:20:26.680 --> 00:20:29.430
is something you wished for yourself.

00:20:29.640 --> 00:20:31.560
If you do not release an album every year,

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:35.360
you will have to pay a large
fine for breach of contract.

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:39.530
You cannot continue to be stubborn.

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:48.950
I intend to gain control over Sound World—
no, over the Sound Cosmos someday.

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:55.250
In order to do so, I need a song
written by you, the legendary guitarist.

00:20:55.460 --> 00:21:00.630
In addition, I have found a player
who can perform your piece perfectly.

00:21:00.840 --> 00:21:05.800
There was some trouble, and the
player has not arrived here yet, however.

00:21:07.220 --> 00:21:10.220
King, are you listening?

00:21:19.070 --> 00:21:21.280
This is our studio!

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:23.490
Wow, it's wonderful!

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:25.610
Do you want to jam a little?

00:21:25.820 --> 00:21:26.110
Huh?

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:27.620
A jam session, pyuru!

00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:30.790
Jam... You mean, play together?

00:21:30.990 --> 00:21:33.580
What else would it be?

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:35.160
L-Let's do it!

00:21:35.370 --> 00:21:37.420
Wait a minute!

00:21:37.630 --> 00:21:40.040
♪ Sing, you cattle ♪

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:42.340
♪ Be dyed in crimson ♪

00:21:42.550 --> 00:21:45.170
♪ Your eyes will change fate ♪

00:21:45.380 --> 00:21:49.010
♪ SHINGANCRIMSONZ ♪

00:21:49.220 --> 00:21:55.890
♪ SHINGANCRIMSONZ ♪

00:22:00.900 --> 00:22:04.070
<i>If you like it, I'm sure you can do it</i>

00:22:04.280 --> 00:22:06.950
<i>You can do it because you like it</i>

00:22:07.160 --> 00:22:09.660
<i>The feeling that you like music</i>

00:22:09.870 --> 00:22:13.040
<i>Can't be stopped by anyone</i>

00:22:13.240 --> 00:22:21.460
<i>GO GO LUCKY Have a nice MUSIC!!</i>

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:23.670
<i>GO GO HAPPY MUSIC!!</i>

00:22:24.630 --> 00:22:27.220
<i>Running through my body</i>

00:22:27.430 --> 00:22:29.760
<i>This electric thrill</i>

00:22:29.970 --> 00:22:34.770
<i>Is this feeling curiosity?</i>

00:22:35.890 --> 00:22:38.310
<i>Negativity is a decrescendo</i>

00:22:38.520 --> 00:22:40.980
<i>Hope and expectations, a crescendo</i>

00:22:41.190 --> 00:22:46.530
<i>Show off our passion and</i>
<i>get god to be our ally, too</i>

00:22:46.740 --> 00:22:52.030
<i>I wanna share with everyone and have a taste of</i>

00:22:52.240 --> 00:22:55.750
<i>Big!! Rocking!! Heart-throbbing!! Happiness!!!!</i>

00:22:56.750 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>If it's you, I'm sure you can do it</i>

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:02.790
<i>You can do it because it's you</i>

00:23:03.000 --> 00:23:07.880
<i>Let's try performing these</i>
<i>dream-colored notes together</i>

00:23:08.090 --> 00:23:11.090
<i>I want to tell you directly</i>

00:23:11.300 --> 00:23:13.930
<i>A life-sized, "heart-sized" heart</i>

00:23:14.140 --> 00:23:16.810
<i>In order for it to reach you...</i>

00:23:17.020 --> 00:23:20.140
<i>I will sing with all I have</i>

00:23:20.350 --> 00:23:22.900
<i>GO GO LUCKY Have a nice MUSIC!!</i>

00:23:23.110 --> 00:23:24.860
<i>GO GO HAPPY MUSIC!!</i>

00:23:28.190 --> 00:23:30.990
Um, was their entrance supposed to be a joke?

00:23:31.200 --> 00:23:33.620
Oh no, next week, I'm sure...

00:23:33.830 --> 00:23:34.580
You're sure—?

00:23:34.780 --> 00:23:38.330
...they'll play a bigger role, maybe?

00:23:38.540 --> 00:23:40.790
Who are they, anyway?
